Package: comic-scroll-reader
Version: 1.0.0
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Alef-0 <alefgabryel123@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Alef-0/Comic-Scroll-Qt-Reader
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgl1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, zlib1g
Description: Fast continuous scroll and single-page reader for comics, manga, and PDFs
 Comic Scroll Reader is a modern desktop viewer designed specifically for
 reading comic folders, webtoons, manga, and PDF documents.
 .
 Features:
  - Continuous vertical scroll mode with seamless page stitching
  - Single page mode with anchored fit-to-width, fit-to-height, and zoom
  - High-performance asynchronous image pipeline
  - Memory-bounded on-demand PDF rendering powered by Google PDFium
  - Comprehensive keyboard and mouse navigation
  - Distraction-free dark user interface with auto-hiding HUD
